"source": "https://www.lecker.de/linsen-kartoffel-curry-suppe-73919.html", "tags": "vegetarisch, kartoffel, suppe", "title": "Linsen-Kartoffel-Curry-Suppe", "titleKey": "linsen kartoffel curry suppe", "updatedAt": "2026-11-02T21:30:00.000Z", "version": 1}'::jsonb),
